# Enabling PWM Backlight at boot
git rev: 1a907254fb8e27fb0e7ad36a854c88137a93ca4e 
Currently we use staging framebuffer TFT driver which has poorly implemented
depndency on the backlight module - in short the LCD driver cannot turn on
pwm_backlight automatically. 
Because of that we made a simple single-line change in the pwm_backlight
driver to make sure that it will be always enabled during a bootup.
In the future we would like to switch to the newer DRM based LCD driver which
should also resolve the automatic enabling of the pwm_backlight (see
BOS-2213).
